OL,3,GNEWSAResidents appeal over street light
OL,4,Aremoval
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Jordanstown, County Antrim
OL,7,Fare appealing to the Department for
OL,8,FInfrastructure (DfI) to reconsider a
OL,9,Fdecision to remove their street lights.
OL,11,FAlmost a hundred families who live in
OL,12,Fthe area around Lenamore Drive/Church
OL,13,FAvenue will be affected by the loss.
OL,15,FTracy and Steven Morris, who have lived
OL,16,Fin the area for almost ten years, said
OL,17,Fit "came completely out of the blue"
OL,18,Fwhen residents received a hand
OL,19,Fdelivered letter earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
