OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents appeal over street light
OL,4,Aremoval
OL,5,
OL,6,FDfI said it intends to "remove any
OL,7,Fconcrete street lighting columns that
OL,8,Fhave been identified as having reached
OL,9,Fthe end of their serviceable life",
OL,10,Fhowever "no formal decision has yet
OL,11,Fbeen taken on whether replacement
OL,12,Flighting will be provided".
